  message: "validation failed (pending_validation->violated): tranch_04 card 030 (F75.A1) reproduced the mechanism on substrate at HEAD eb5355917e (reused tranch-03 substrate sha256 a32c4a31). Edge.derived_from is DEGENERATE: all 23867 populated edges (21.59%, linker-only, 13 passes) have derived_from == {src,dst} EXACTLY, uniform chain-len 2, even for 1008 non-containment edges where the producer could name a 3rd consumed input; zero provenance beyond endpoints; the '(or Edge)' clause is unexercised. The PR #3926 'landed' state populated the field mechanically but did NOT achieve the invariant's intent (record the Symbols the linker CONSUMED beyond the endpoints) — so the goal is not met. blind severity 4. Active fix-work item: WI-latup (populate derived_from with real consumed inputs at ~20 linker sites). Duplicate finding WI-ratun is wont_do (flagged to operator)."  # 0a0c
